				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/287/949/593/182/322/original/ea34d8a24964f103.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-29T13:59:44.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> One reason I haven't even bothered looking into Variable Fonts beyond the initial concept is I saw how freaking huge the file size is on them. (Well, the ones I looked at anyway) <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@stoyan\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stoyan</span></a></span></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "113391074572453892",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://social.lol/@r0b/113391074522746226",
			"author": {
				"name": "Rob Anderson",
				"url": "https://social.lol/@r0b",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/113/391/039/856/247/400/original/057048f687fc13c8.jpeg"
			},
			"date": "2024-10-29T14:01:27.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@stoyan\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stoyan</span></a></span> </p><p>I was wondering about this the other month, there was a variable version of a font we were using that was like 1.3Mb, surely that defeats the point!</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "113391090720828688",
			"parentId": "113391074572453892",
