			"date": "2024-10-29T16:31:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://typo.social/@simoncozens\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>simoncozens</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I used --LATIN subset for the experiment. YsabeauInfant[wght]-subset ended up being 241 characters where US_ASCII should be 95-ish right?</p>",
